@* Styles of the departure and return screens (rendered once by each page; the back office has no CSS isolation bundle).
   Tablet first: one step per screen, touch targets of 48 px at least, text contrast of 4.5:1 at least, a state is
   shown by its text and an icon, never by colour alone. Logical properties for the future right-to-left layout. *@
<style>
